From: Zurker <91011862+hershate@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 13:50:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Papo: zero-listener gate for PlayerArmSwingEvent in
 handleAnimate
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ServerboundSwingPacket is one of the highest-frequency packets in PvP/mining
scenarios; every packet built a PlayerArmSwingEvent and dispatched it even with
no plugin listening. PlayerArmSwingEvent declares no HandlerList of its own and
is PlayerAnimationEvent's only subclass, so all its listeners register into
PlayerAnimationEvent's table — an empty table provably means nobody observes
the event, callEvent is a no-op and isCancelled() is always false, so control
flow always reaches swing().

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerGamePacketListenerImpl.java b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerGamePacketListenerImpl.java
index edfcadd1aa60ab0cae9fc8a90aa7b4d944ac3462..28dcc50bdef64c51c6c61a35c0b306ee50e11e3d 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerGamePacketListenerImpl.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerGamePacketListenerImpl.java
@@ -2707,10 +2707,17 @@ public class ServerGamePacketListenerImpl
         // Papo end
 
         // Arm swing animation
+        // Papo start - skip event construction when there are no listeners. PlayerArmSwingEvent
+        // declares no HandlerList of its own; it is PlayerAnimationEvent's only subclass, so all
+        // its listeners register into PlayerAnimationEvent's table. Zero listeners => callEvent
+        // is a no-op and isCancelled() is always false, so control flow always reaches swing().
+        if (org.bukkit.event.player.PlayerAnimationEvent.getHandlerList().getRegisteredListeners().length > 0) {
+        // Papo end
         io.papermc.paper.event.player.PlayerArmSwingEvent event = new io.papermc.paper.event.player.PlayerArmSwingEvent(this.getCraftPlayer(), org.bukkit.craftbukkit.CraftEquipmentSlot.getHand(packet.getHand())); // Paper - Add PlayerArmSwingEvent
         this.cserver.getPluginManager().callEvent(event);
 
         if (event.isCancelled()) return;
+        } // Papo - end zero-listener gate
         // CraftBukkit end
         this.player.swing(packet.getHand());
     }
